// this is the statistics block that is used for ALL holy symbols; copy from BG2 belt12, 13, or 14
@216 = ~STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Strength: +1
– Magic Resistance: +5%
– Can memorize one extra 6th- and 7th-level Cleric spell

Weight: 0~

@10308 =~Moon Shield 
(Alteration)

Level: 5
Sphere: Protection
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the Silverstar receives resistance to all magic.  The resistance conferred is 2% per level of the cleric up to a maximum of 40% at 20th level.  This resistance is set so if the target already has more magic resistance than the cleric would confer, it will actually lower it to the set value.  This effect will last for the duration of the spell or until dispelled.~


@10624 = ~Created by the Dark Bolt spell. When thrown at opponents they cause 2d4 points of cold damage as well as causing silence on a failed save vs. spell. Undead creatures must also make a save vs. paralyzation or be held for one round. 

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Target must save vs. Spell or be silenced for one round
– Undead targets must also save vs. Paralyzation or be held for one round

THAC0: +2
Damage: 2d4 (cold)

Weight: 0~

@11206 = ~Endurance of Ilmater
(Necromancy)

Level: 1
Sphere: Necromantic, Protection
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 round + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell doubles the hit points of the spell recipient for the spell duration. Any damage suffered is taken first from these phantom hit points until they are all exhausted; damage is then taken from the real hit points of the affected being.

All saving throws receive a +2 bonus. In addition, no being protected by Endurance of Ilmater can be knocked over, trampled, ridden down, or overthrown; all protected beings can stand firm against all charges.~
